-- ============================================================================
-- tests-independent.l4 -- written by an independent test author who wrote answers.md (276 questions, md5 in lead/answers.md5)
-- from the text before opening the encoding.  Every expected value is the one in answers.md, never one copied from running the code.
-- Tags: Qn = a question of answers.md asserted as written (or through the other seat, marked via-other-seat);
--       D-Qn = an extra question decided from the text in Step B, before running, where the seat asks a nearby question;
--       Qn [layer-1 function] = asked through a layer-1 function the seat body names;
--       UNTESTABLE Qn = no seat question or function can ask it.
-- ============================================================================

